{"seq":7,"slug":"high-energy-astrophysics","title":"高能天体物理与多信使天文学","stage":"DONE","category":"astronomy-cosmology","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics","rating":{"composite":3.66,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"高能天体物理与多信使天文学\">高能天体物理与多信使天文学</h1><p>高能天体物理研究宇宙中最极端的环境——强引力、强磁场、相对论性速度、超核密度——以及它们发出的高能辐射与粒子。多信使天文学则是它的当代延伸：不再只用光子看宇宙，而是同时用引力波、中微子、宇宙线这些全新信使，在同一个天体事件上交叉验证。本 hub 把这两条脉络合为一体，按&quot;机制—天体—信使—设施&quot;四个递进的章节展开。</p>\n<p>第一章从最底层的物理机制讲起：高能光子怎样产生。相对论性电子在磁场中发同步辐射、撞光子做逆康普顿，高温等离子体发韧致辐射与热盘辐射，而这一切的前提——把粒子加速到极端能量的费米机制与磁重联——构成了理解后续一切现象的语言。没有这一章，后面的能谱和信使都无从解读。</p>\n<p>第二章把机制安放到具体天体上：中子星与脉冲星把超核密度和超强磁场变成现实，黑洞与吸积盘是宇宙最高效的引擎，伽马射线暴则是最剧烈的瞬变爆发。这些致密天体既是第一章辐射机制的极端应用场，又是第三章各类信使的发源地——双中子星并合一次性串起引力波、短伽马暴、千新星与重元素合成。</p>\n<p>第三章转向多信使本身：引力波直接测量时空应变，看见电磁波看不见的&quot;黑暗&quot;并合；高能中微子穿透一切、直线传播，是强子加速的确凿证据；宇宙线能量最高却因带电而难以溯源。三类信使各有所长、互为补充，共同突破了纯电磁观测的极限。</p>\n<p>第四章落到工程与协调：高能光子需要掠射镜、对产生径迹仪、切伦科夫望远镜等迥异于光学的设施；引力波天文台要测出比质子还小千倍的长度变化；而把全球分散的设施在分秒间焊成一个系统的，是多信使联合警报网络——它是整个 hub 的收束点，让前述所有机制、天体与信使最终在同一事件上汇合。</p>\n<p>四章层层递进：机制是语法，天体是句子，信使是不同的阅读方式，设施与联测则是把这一切付诸实践的眼睛与神经。读者既可顺序通读建立完整框架，也可借各文档间密布的交叉链接，从任一兴趣点切入这张知识网络。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"radiation-mechanisms","title":"高能辐射机制","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics/radiation-mechanisms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"synchrotron-inverse-compton","title":"同步辐射与逆康普顿","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics/radiation-mechanisms/synchrotron-inverse-compton"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bremsstrahlung-thermal","title":"韧致辐射与热辐射","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics/radiation-mechanisms/bremsstrahlung-thermal"},{"seq":3,"slug":"particle-acceleration","title":"粒子加速机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics/radiation-mechanisms/particle-acceleration"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"compact-objects","title":"致密天体","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics/compact-objects","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"neutron-stars-pulsars","title":"中子星与脉冲星","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics/compact-objects/neutron-stars-pulsars"},{"seq":2,"slug":"black-holes-accretion","title":"黑洞与吸积盘","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics/compact-objects/black-holes-accretion"},{"seq":3,"slug":"gamma-ray-bursts","title":"伽马射线暴","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics/compact-objects/gamma-ray-bursts"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"multi-messenger","title":"多信使探测","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics/multi-messenger","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gravitational-waves","title":"引力波探测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics/multi-messenger/gravitational-waves"},{"seq":2,"slug":"high-energy-neutrinos","title":"高能中微子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics/multi-messenger/high-energy-neutrinos"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cosmic-rays","title":"宇宙线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics/multi-messenger/cosmic-rays"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"facilities-coordination","title":"观测设施与联测","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics/facilities-coordination","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"xray-gamma-telescopes","title":"X 射线与伽马望远镜","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics/facilities-coordination/xray-gamma-telescopes"},{"seq":2,"slug":"gw-observatories","title":"引力波天文台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics/facilities-coordination/gw-observatories"},{"seq":3,"slug":"joint-alerts","title":"多信使联合警报","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics/facilities-coordination/joint-alerts"}]}]}